/* ENVLP Windows resources.
 *
 * The manifest is what makes Windows load Common-Controls 6.0, which
 * wxWidgets 3.3 requires (GetWindowSubclass & friends are exported by
 * name only from comctl32 v6). Resource id 1 with type 24 (RT_MANIFEST)
 * is the process manifest.
 *
 * The icon is resource id 1 of type 3 (RT_ICON) via the ICON statement;
 * Windows uses the lowest-numbered icon as the executable's icon in
 * Explorer and the taskbar. ENVLP.ico is built from ENVLP.svg by
 * tools/make_icon.ps1. */
1 24 "ENVLP.manifest"
1 ICON "ENVLP.ico"
